@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@merchantA = demo-merchant-a
@merchantB = demo-merchant-b

### 自定义 Controller 创建文章：扁平载荷，无需 payload 包装，商家归属由内核填充
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"本店营业公告","content":"本周正常营业，欢迎光临。"}

> {% client.global.set("articleId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 自定义分页：列表固定投影 id/title，不携带正文，按本人范围计数
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/articles/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"page":1,"limit":10}

### 自定义详情：内核按主键与可信商家范围查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/articles/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}

### 另一商家无法读取这篇文章：404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/articles/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantB}}

### 类型化 UpdatePatch：路由提供目标 ID，未提交的正文保持不变
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/articles/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"本店营业公告（更新）"}

### 另一商家不能修改：409，内核将可信归属加入最终 UPDATE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/articles/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"越权修改"}

### 空标题由实体 @NotBlank 校验拒绝：400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/articles/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":" "}

### 自定义接口可用，但通用文章 HTTP 已关闭：404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantArticle/list
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 删除文章：内核执行归属约束、事务及审计
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/articles/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
